=========================================================================================================================
Not applied. exopipe_ops belongs to its owning chat: apply it there, by its commit, when Gregg rules that the size / axis rule
at every S/N replaces the conformance's axis step (the refactor's catalog_conform.CONFORM_AXIS_UNDER_RULE = 'replace').
Apply from /lustre/gh/main/exopipe_ops:   git apply <this file>      (patch(1) is not installed on the nodes; git apply
